<title>USA: Proler reaffirms Schnitzer recommendation.</title>
<headline>Proler reaffirms Schnitzer recommendation.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Proler International Corp said on Tuesday it reaffirmed its recommendation that shareholders accept the tender and merger offer by Schnitzer Steel Industries Inc.</p>
<p>Schnitzer is conducting an all cash, all shares tender offer for Proler stock at $9 per share under a merger agreement with Proler, the company said. But Hugo Neu Corp has also announced a proposal to acquire Proler though a tender offer and merger at $9 per share, Proler said.</p>
</text>
